d tactical combat set above a shattered world. Transform a lone vessel into an industrial empire above a planet scarred by cataclysm\u2014a silent world where vast automated networks once thrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extract. Automate. Arm. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/8968ad8ccd421638a6be1c87fcde85b9.avif?t=1770065038\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras_big/8968ad8ccd421638a6be1c87fcde85b9.webp?t=1770065038 width=1560 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/659e43f2b68a390c8f91aae931edf769.poster.avif?t=1770065038\" width=1166 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1085860/extras/659e43f2b68a390c8f91aae931edf769.webm?t=1770065038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beauty below masks rogue derelicts and hostile factions that treat your industry as prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Teeth:</strong> Power isn\u2019t bought; it\u2019s forged. Manufacture cannons, lasers, and missiles to weaponize your drone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense in Depth:</strong> Deploy multi-layered orbital grids to protect your logistics from raids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_parag